<title>SWEDEN: Swedish EMU stance unveiled in May or June-Asbrink.</title>
<headline>Swedish EMU stance unveiled in May or June-Asbrink.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Tuesday his ruling Social Democratic party would announce its position on Europe's economic and monetary union (EMU) in May or June.  </p>
<p>&quot;We have not yet decided any date for this, it can be in May or in June,&quot; Asbrink told reporters after a speech at a labour market seminar.</p>
<p>-- Peter Fellman, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1019</p>
</text>
